CON-08: keep a MASS-type load that reaches a node with no flow

QualitySolver::mixAtNodes() booked a MASS-type inflow as External Inflow
but, like legacy, ignored qual_mass_in when the node's inflow was at or
below ZERO, so the load went nowhere (100 % quality continuity error). Mix
such a load into the stored water of a reactor node that holds water; at a
node that holds none, add it to qual_routing_final_dry, where the contents
of a node or link that dries out already go. Same rule as
CON-08_swmm530.patch.

Requires: NUM-45

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b,
after NUM-45_swmm600.patch:
    git apply CON-08_swmm600.patch

